00:56:29.100 --> 00:56:46.840
<v Ira  Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who describes the family that is WBEZ this way--
<v Ira  Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责，他这样描述WBEZ这个大家庭——

00:56:46.840 --> 00:56:59.350
<v Glenn>People who blithely say things will get better over time have never been here. Things never get better.
<v Glenn>“那些轻率地说‘时间会治愈一切’的人从来没经历过这些。事情永远不会变好。”

00:56:59.350 --> 00:57:19.760
<v Ira   Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira   Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:57:19.760 --> 00:57:24.760
